WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.779
Tender packs are long, and one miss loses the bid.

2
00:00:06.079 --> 00:00:09.594
Send us the tender pack. No calls needed.

3
00:00:10.894 --> 00:00:23.251
Usually within a day you get a bid at a glance: every pass-or-fail condition, every document to submit, how bids are scored and the key dates, each quoted from the source so you can check it.

4
00:00:24.551 --> 00:00:28.493
In this sample, it found 30 bidder-facing requirements.

5
00:00:29.793 --> 00:00:38.321
Price carries only 10%; compliance with the specification and experience carry 25% each.

6
00:00:39.621 --> 00:00:46.937
In another tender, the insurance was given as £1m in one place and £10m in another.

7
00:00:48.237 --> 00:00:55.580
We do not submit bids for you. We do not guarantee a win. Your team signs off every answer.

8
00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:02.191
Bid Check. £600 per tender. Usually within a day.
